--- 
Title: Stuffed Mushrooms
Tags: Sidekicks
---

In #bowl{} mix together @Cheddar Cheese{1 cup}, @Butter{2 Tablespoons}, minced @Garlic{5 cloves}, diced @Parsley{1/8 cup}, @Salt, & @Black Pepper.

Remove the stems from @Mushrooms{20 button mushrooms} and fill the caps with the cheese mixture.

Place on an #aluminum covered #baking sheet{}.

Bake in a preheated oven at 375°F for 15 minutes, or until the mushrooms are tender and the cheese is melted and golden brown.